<title>SPAIN: Spain's Argentaria ups total dividend to 277 pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Argentaria ups total dividend to 277 pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Corporacion Bancaria de Espana (Argentaria) said on Thursday its total 1996 gross dividend will be 277 pesetas versus 270 pesetas in 1995.</p>
<p>The statement said its second interim dividend will be 72 pesetas gross versus 70 pesetas, payable on February 24.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
